<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<form:Form xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:core="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/mcore" xmlns:form="http://g5.1c.ru/v8/dt/form">
  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>Decoration</name>
    <id>18</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>If the packaging unit was used in documents, it is not recommended that you change attributes which influence the packaging unit factor in relation to product storage unit.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>اگر واحد بسته‌بندی در اسناد استفاده شده باشد، توصیه نمی‌شود ویژگی‌هایی را که بر ضریب واحد بسته‌بندی نسبت به واحد نگهداری محصول اثر می‌گذارند تغییر دهید.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Non si consiglia di modificare i requisiti che influenzano il coefficiente di imballaggio relativamente all'unità di stoccaggio dell'articolo, se l'imballaggio è già stato usato nei documenti.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Atrybuty, które wpływają na współczynnik opakowania stosunkowo jednostki składowania towaru, nie zaleca się zmieniać, jeżeli opakowanie już zostało użyte w dokumentach.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Реквизиты, влияющие на коэффициент упаковки относительно единицы хранения номенклатуры, не рекомендуется изменять, если упаковка уже использовалась в документах.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Paketleme ünitesi zaten belgelerde kullanılmış ise, stok ölçü birimine göre paketleme ünitesi faktörünü etkileyen özniteliklerin değiştirilmesi önerilmemektedir.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Không nên thay đổi các thuộc tính ảnh hưởng đến yếu tố đóng gói liên quan đến đơn vị tính lưu trữ sản phẩm nếu bộ đóng gói được sử dụng trong chứng từ.</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>DecorationExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>22</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>DecorationContextMenu</name>
      <id>19</id>
      <autoFill>true</autoFill>
    </contextMenu>
    <type>Label</type>
    <maxWidth>40</maxWidth>
    <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
    <skipOnInput>false</skipOnInput>
    <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
      <color>Web.FireBrick</color>
    </textColor>
    <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
      <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
    </extInfo>
  </items>
  <autoCommandBar>
    <name>FormCommandBar</name>
    <id>-1</id>
    <items xsi:type="form:Button">
      <name>EnableEdit</name>
      <id>5</id>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <skipOnInput>false</skipOnInput>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>EnableEditExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>20</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <commandName>Form.Command.EnableEdit</commandName>
      <representation>Auto</representation>
      <defaultButton>true</defaultButton>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <placementArea>UserCmds</placementArea>
      <representationInContextMenu>Auto</representationInContextMenu>
    </items>
    <items xsi:type="form:Button">
      <name>Close</name>
      <id>12</id>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <skipOnInput>false</skipOnInput>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>CloseExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>21</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <commandName>Form.StandardCommand.Close</commandName>
      <representation>PictureAndText</representation>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <placementArea>UserCmds</placementArea>
      <representationInContextMenu>Auto</representationInContextMenu>
    </items>
    <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
  </autoCommandBar>
  <handlers>
    <event>OnCreateAtServer</event>
    <name>OnCreateAtServer</name>
  </handlers>
  <saveWindowSettings>true</saveWindowSettings>
  <autoTitle>true</autoTitle>
  <autoUrl>true</autoUrl>
  <group>Vertical</group>
  <autoFillCheck>true</autoFillCheck>
  <allowFormCustomize>true</allowFormCustomize>
  <enabled>true</enabled>
  <showTitle>true</showTitle>
  <showCloseButton>true</showCloseButton>
